# TODO

The open tasks and the architecture decisions in this vault, as queries rather
than lists somebody maintains.

## Still to do

```hql#eval
cards
| filter(c => c.metadata.status == "todo")
| sort(by = c => match c.metadata.priority { some(Int p) => p, _ => 0 })
| map(c => c.title)
```

## Architecture decisions

```hql#eval
cards
| filter(c => c.metadata.type == "adr")
| sort(by = c => match c.metadata.date { some(String d) => d, _ => "" })
| map(c => {
    title: c.title,
    status: c.metadata.status,
    date: c.metadata.date
  })
```
